      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm writing a paper for my theology class on how traditionalist religious views clash with modern secular ideas about marriage and family. could you help me out by summarizing the main moral arguments that traditionalist theologians use when they criticize recent changes in how society defines marriage? i really want to get into the heart of their moral reasoning so i can represent their side accurately.",
